  "job_B1.5.12_20251001_193243": {
    "text": "Incipit Sermo De Dedicatione Aecclesiae.\nLucas se godspellere awrat on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feriddan Cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t ure h\u00e6lend Crist w\u00e6s farende to \u00fe\u00e6re byrig\n\u00dea worhte he wundra be \u00feam wege swaswa his gewuna w\u00e6s.\n& betwux o\u00f0rum wundrum on \u00feam wege he geh\u00e6lde \u00e6nne blindne, for\u00fean \u00fee he b\u00e6d his h\u00e6le mid\n& he swa dyde; & \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00fee \u00feis wundor geseah swi\u00f0e herede god; Se h\u00e6lend ferde \u00fea \u00feurh \u00fea burh\n\u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r sum welig mann ongeanwerd \u00feam h\u00e6lende & hys nama w\u00e6s Zacheus, Se w\u00e6s ealdor &\nHe smeade \u00fea on hys mode, hu he mihte \u00feone h\u00e6lend geseon, for\u00fean\u00fee se ylca rica w\u00e6s sceort on\nHe arn \u00fea beforan ealra \u00fe\u00e6re meniu, & ardlice astah uppan an treow, \u00f0e is on bocum gehaten\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea se h\u00e6lend sona swa he him to com, beseah upp wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s rican, & hine hra\u00f0e het astigan ni\u00feer\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se h\u00e6lend him to, Nu to d\u00e6g me gedafena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic to \u00feinre dugo\u00f0e gecyrre, & \u00fe\u00e6t ic on \u00feinum\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea iudeiscean \u00fe\u00e6s wundrodon swi\u00f0e, & mid ceorunge bem\u00e6ndon \u00fe\u00e6t he to swa synfullum menn\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe se h\u00e6lend sona to Zachee \u00feus, Nu to d\u00e6g is gefremmed \u00feisum hirede h\u00e6l, for\u00fean\u00fee he is sunu\nMannes bearn com to secenne, & sylf to geh\u00e6lenne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee of mancynne on middan earde losode.\n\u00d0es rica Zacheus wolde \u00feone h\u00e6lend geseon ac he ne mihte for \u00fe\u00e6re meniu, ne eac \u00fea lenge n\u00e6fde.\n\u00dea arn he beforan & astah uppan \u00fe\u00e6t fores\u00e6de treo \u00fe\u00e6t he hine geseon mihte.\nSe h\u00e6lend eac \u00fea geseah his godan willan, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde to him gecyrran, & on his huse hine\nHe ne dorste \u00feone h\u00e6lend to his huse la\u00f0ian, ac mid \u00fe\u00e6re gewilnunge \u00fee he wolde hine geseon, he\nSe h\u00e6lend beseah up wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s rican, & he hine geseah, for\u00fean\u00fee he hine geceas fram \u00feam woroldlicum\nGodes gesyh\u00f0 getacna\u00f0 his gecorennesse o\u00f0\u00f0e his lufe, swaswa hit awriten is, Oculi domini super\nWe menn eac swylce \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee we lufia\u00f0 we gewilnia\u00f0 to geseonne, & fram \u00feam \u00fee we onscunia\u00f0, we\nSe h\u00e6lend geseah \u00feone welegan, for\u00fean\u00fee se welega geseah hine, & Crist geceas \u00feone \u00fee hine geceas,\n\u00de\u00e6s folces meniu \u00fee mid \u00feam h\u00e6lende ferde hremdon \u00feone rican \u00fe\u00e6t he ne mihte \u00feone h\u00e6lend geseon,\nHi forbudon \u00feam blindan \u00fe\u00e6t he to \u00feam h\u00e6lende ne clypode, ac he clypode \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee swi\u00f0or, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se\nSeo meniu \u00fee hine hremdon getacnodon \u00fea fl\u00e6sclican lustas, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s mannes mod oft hrepa\u00f0, \u00feonne he\n\u00de\u00e6t treowcynn is sicomorus gehaten; hit is on leafum & on bogum morbeame gelic, bi\u00f0 swa \u00feeah\nHit getacna\u00fe \u00fea halgan rode, \u00fee \u00fea geleaffullan lufia\u00f0, & \u00fea ungeleaffullan forseo\u00f0.\nMid \u00fe\u00e6re halgan rode tacne we us bletsia\u00f0 on Godes naman, & we beo\u00f0 wi\u00f0 deofles costunga gescylde,\nBe \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00fe se apostol Paulus, Nos autem predicamus Christum crucifixum, iudeis quidem\nZacheus is gecweden iustificatus, \u00fe\u00e6t is gerihtwisod, for\u00fean\u00fee god hine gerihtwisode, & he getacna\u00fe\nSwaswa Zacheus astah \u00fe\u00e6t treow \u00fe\u00e6t he mihte beon geuferod, swa astiga\u00f0 \u00fea geleaffullan, \u00feonne hi\nBe \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00fe eft se ylca \u00feeoda lareow, Non enim iudicaui me scire aliquid inter uos, nisi christum\n\u00d0eos is seo hergendlice ea\u00f0modnes \u00fe\u00e6t se h\u00e6lend wolde for us \u00ferowian, & mid his anes dea\u00f0e ealne\nHit \u00feuhte \u00feam dysegum h\u00e6\u00feenum \u00fe\u00e6t seo d\u00e6d waclic w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde sylfwilles on rode beon\nNe mihte na\u00feor ne engel ne heahengel, ne heahf\u00e6der ne witega, ne apostol, ne nan o\u00f0er halga, ne gold\nSe h\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Zachee, nu to d\u00e6g me gedafena\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t ic to \u00feinre dugo\u00f0e gecyrre, & \u00fe\u00e6t ic on\nHine gela\u00feode hwilon sum iudeisc sundorhalga to his huse, ac he hine ne underfeng na mid swilcum\nWe magon eac gewislicor eow onwreon be \u00fean.\nSum iudeisc sundorhalga w\u00e6s gehaten Simon, se gela\u00feode \u00feone h\u00e6lend to his gereorde, & he swa\n\u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r on \u00fe\u00e6re byrig Hierusalem sum synful wif swi\u00felice forscyldgod on forligere, & heo \u00fea\n& brohte \u00feyder hyre sealfbox mid deorwyr\u00fere sealfe, & stod \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes fotum bewepende hyre\n\u00dea geseah se sundorhalga \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fee hine gela\u00feode & cw\u00e6\u00fe on his ge\u00feance \u00feus, Gif \u00fees lareow witiga\nSe h\u00e6lend \u00fea andwyrde his ge\u00feance \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende, Simon ic h\u00e6bbe \u00fee sum \u00feing to secgenne.\nAnd he cw\u00e6\u00f0, la leof lareow, sege.\nSe h\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 him to, Twegen gafolgylderas w\u00e6ron feoh scyldige sumum massere, se an him\nHw\u00e6t \u00feinc\u00f0 \u00fee nu, Simon, hw\u00e6\u00feer heora lufode hine swi\u00feor.\n\u00dea andwyrde Simon & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic wene \u00fe\u00e6t se hine lufode swi\u00f0or, \u00feam \u00fee he mare forgeaf.\nHim andwyrde se h\u00e6lend & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Rihtlice \u00feu demdest.\nHe beseah \u00fea to \u00feam wife & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Simone, Simon, gesyhst \u00feu \u00feis wif?\nIc com into \u00feinum huse, & \u00feu ne bude me fur\u00feon to minum fotum w\u00e6ter, & \u00feis wif a\u00fewoh mine fet\n\u00deu noldest me cyssan.\n& \u00feis wif sy\u00fe\u00fean heo in com, ne geswac mine fet to cyssanne.\n\u00deu ne smyredest min heafod mid ele, & heo smyrede mine fet mid deorwur\u00f0re sealfe.\nFor\u00fei ic secge \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t hyre menifealdan synna beo\u00f0 hyre forgifene, for\u00fean \u00fee heo swa swy\u00fee me\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se h\u00e6lend to \u00feam wife, \u00fee synd \u00feine synna forgifene.\nAnd \u00fea ymbsittendan sona \u00feus cw\u00e6don, hw\u00e6t is \u00fees \u00fee eac swylce synna forgif\u00f0?\nSe h\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea git to \u00feam wife, \u00fein geleafa \u00fee geh\u00e6lde, gang \u00fee nu on sibbe.\n\u00d0ises Simones welwillendnes n\u00e6s swa fulfremed on \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes tocyme, swaswa Zachees w\u00e6s,\n\u00dea iudeiscan ceorodon \u00fea\u00fea hi gesawon \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde gecyrran to Zachees huse, cwe\u00feende hwi he\n\u00c6fre hi andedon arleaslice \u00fe\u00e6t se h\u00e6lend wolde \u00fea h\u00e6\u00feenan \u00feeoda him to folce geceosan, & to\nZacheus \u00fea stod on his gebeorscipe & bli\u00feelice cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam h\u00e6lende, Ic wylle nu min drihten d\u00e6lan\n& \u00feone o\u00feerne d\u00e6l syllan \u00feearfum & w\u00e6dlum, & gif ic hwylcne mannan bereafode, \u00fe\u00e6t ic forgylde\nSe h\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00e6r to sumum o\u00f0rum rican men \u00fea\u00fea he hine befran hu he mihte \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif begitan,\nSwahwaswa unscyldiglice butan facne leofode \u00e6r his gecyrrednysse, se m\u00e6g his \u00e6hta ealle \u00feearfum\n\u00deeos is seo wise stuntnys \u00fe\u00e6t man woruld\u00feing forseo his agen forl\u00e6te, & \u00fea ungesewenlican\nFor\u00feig Zacehus heold healfe his \u00e6hta, \u00fe\u00e6t he mihte his unriht be feowerfealdum gebetan, & \u00fea\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se h\u00e6lend to Zachee, Nu to d\u00e6g is h\u00e6l \u00feisum hirede gelumpen, for\u00fean\u00fee he so\u00felice is sunu\nSeo ece h\u00e6l & \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif becom \u00feam hiredes ealdre Zachee & his hirede \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes tocyme,\nNu cwi\u00f0 sum man on his ge\u00feance \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fees Zacheus ges\u00e6lig w\u00e6re \u00feurh swylcne cuman, \u00fe\u00e6t he moste\nSo\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t is ges\u00e6lig he w\u00e6s, ac swa \u00feeah ne \u00feurfe we for\u00fei ceorian, \u00fe\u00e6t we nabba\u00f0 Crist lichamlice nu\nFor\u00fean\u00fee he sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0 on his godspelle, Quamdiu fecistis uni de his fratribus meis minimis, mihi\nSwa hw\u00e6t swa ge do\u00f0 to gode hafenleasum mannum on godes naman.\n\u00de\u00e6t ge do\u00f0 gode sylfum, & he hit forgilt eow eft be hundfealdum.\nGode beo\u00f0 \u00fea \u00feenunga \u00fee man godes \u00feearfum de\u00f0, & swi\u00f0ost \u00fea \u00fee man godes \u00feeowum de\u00fe.\n\u00de\u00e6t godspel cwy\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se welega w\u00e6re Habrahames sunu; for\u00fean \u00fee he geefenl\u00e6hte mid his d\u00e6dum\nBe \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00f0 se \u00feeoda lareow Paulus to \u00feam geleaffullum, Si autem uos christi, ergo habrah\u00e6 semen\nMannes sunu com to secenne & to geh\u00e6lenne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee losode.\nSe h\u00e6lend sylf is mannes sunu anes mannes, swaswa nan o\u00f0er man nis.\nHe is mannes sunu on \u00fe\u00e6re menniscnysse \u00fe\u00e6re eadigan Marian, seo \u00fee is m\u00e6den & modor, & he is\nWe \u00fee forlorene w\u00e6ron, & us \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif forgifan mid him sylfum, & mid eallum his halgum, gif we\nUs gedafena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we beon gemyndige ures h\u00e6lendes mildheortnysse on us.\n& his lare to worce awendan, \u00fee l\u00e6s \u00fee we \u00fea sti\u00fean \u00fereale gehyran, \u00fee he sumum receleasum cw\u00e6\u00f0,\n\u00c6lc \u00fe\u00e6ra manna \u00fee cym\u00f0 to me, & mine spr\u00e6ce gehyr\u00f0, & hi mid weorcum gefyl\u00f0, ic geswutelige\nHe by\u00f0 gelic \u00feam men \u00fee ar\u00e6r\u00f0 him st\u00e6nen botl, & dylf\u00f0 \u00feone grundweall swy\u00fee deopne & leg\u00f0 hine\nEft \u00feonne se storm cym\u00f0 him to, & \u00fe\u00e6t flod slyh\u00f0 on \u00fea gebytlu.\n\u00deonne \u00e6tstent \u00fe\u00e6t hus f\u00e6ste, for\u00fean \u00fee hit w\u00e6s getimbrod on \u00feam stane.\nWitodlice se\u00fee gehyr\u00f0 mine spr\u00e6ce, & nele hi mid weorcum gefyllan, he bi\u00f0 \u00feam men gelic \u00fee bytla\u00f0\n\u00deonne cym\u00f0 f\u00e6rlice se storm & \u00fe\u00e6t flod, & towenda\u00f0 \u00fea getimbrunge grundlunga; \u00fe\u00e6t is se man \u00fee\nEalswa se man \u00fee his hiht & his geornfulnysse on \u00feisse worulde gitsunge beset, his geswinc him\nGif we so\u00f0lice Cristene beo\u00f0, \u00feonne ne sceal us nan woruldgestreon beon swa inmede swa ures",
